eps B5-B6-B7-B8 which can form B5-B6-B7 or B6-B7-B8 chows flexibly. This maintains the best tile efficiency with W4 as a potential pair, giving me a solid structure toward a winning hand worth at least 8 points with patterns like \"All Chows\" (2 points) + \"One Voided Suit\" (1 point) + additional patterns.\n\nAnswer: Play T2"}
